{"id":"wb-6-721","name":"庞统祠墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"庞统祠墓","text":"庞统祠墓，又名龙凤祠。在四川省德阳市罗江区白马关镇，祠墓为东汉建安十九年（214年）庞统中流矢卒后，蜀汉昭烈帝刘备所建。整个祠墓内松柏参天，奇石沟壑，景色十分怡人，是有名的蜀汉遗迹。1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%9E%E7%BB%9F%E7%A5%A0%E5%A2%93","revisionId":93086770,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93086770","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fc49541e2e59a5b2090eccad.jpg","title":"庞统祠墓照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BA%9E%E7%BB%9F%E7%A5%A0%E5%A2%93%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/%E5%BA%9E%E7%BB%9F%E7%A5%A0%E5%A2%93%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Pang Tong memorial hall and tomb","width":320,"height":201}}